UID:fbQs49jYPq
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 108 mins (1h48m)\n\nUnmissable directorial debut sat
 irizing and skewering content culture from iconic alt-comedian John Early\
 , who plays the titular role\, alongside a troupe of comedians including K
 ate Berlant\, Vanessa Bayer\, and Conner O’Malley.  From July 17 to 19\,
  all 7:00pm screenings will include a pre-recorded Q&A with John Early and
  one of these special guests:July 17 - Amy SedarisJuly 18 - Hannah Einbind
 erJuly 19 - Sarah Sherman\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/maddi
 es-secret-yr\n\nEstimated start: 13:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
